---
intent: >
  Remove all extra bin entries from package.json (aide-tree, server), simplify
  the .mcp.json generation to always use cmd /c form, add aide-tree as a
  local project script written during aide_init (following the same
  canonical-content-via-initContent pattern used for commands/skills), bump
  the patch version, and update all affected specs, tests, and docs.
---

## Plan

